    "body": "## Problem\n\n1. Numeric `skip()` and `nth()` can skip an extra item after `peek()`.\n2. Predicate `skip()` continues removing matches beyond the first non-matching value.\n3. Cached `false` values are mistaken for absent values or iterator exhaustion.\n4. `last()` stops at `false` and drops additional return values.\n\n## Solution\n\n1. Let `next()` consume peeked values normally during numeric skipping. ac04489ad3\n2. Stop applying the skip predicate after its first non-match. 6471b1742e\n3. Use explicit nil checks for cache presence and exhaustion. 708bab4c43\n4. Drain `last()` while preserving all return values, including trailing nils, using a reusable buffer. 0eff75a403",
